SUMMARY:Panama: Law 462 phases in higher employer social security contribut
 ions through 2029
DESCRIPTION:Upcoming\, 1 Mar 2027 (Phased: 1 Mar 2027 and 1 Mar 2029). Law 
 No. 462\, enacted on 18 March 2025\, reforms Panama's social security syst
 em. The employer contribution is 13.25% until 28 February 2027\, rises to 
 14.25% from 1 March 2027\, and to 15.25% from 1 March 2029. The employee c
 ontribution remains fixed at 9.75% of gross salary.\n\nSource: https://fmm
 .com.pa/panama-social-security-reform-2025-key-highlights-of-law-no-462/\n
 Details: https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/countries/panama.html#pa-insura
 nce\n\nFor information only\, not legal or tax advice. Sources last checke
 d 1 October 2026.
URL:https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/countries/panama.html#pa-insurance
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
